>As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 7 grids came in under 90% of normal in April to May 35 times in 75 years, and in October to November 37 times. In 2025 on the middle of the grids, June to July ran 152% of normal and September to October ran 47%. So far in 2026, January to February came in at 11% of normal on the middle of the grids. Grid 28333 had its driest year in 1976 at 48% of normal.</p>"}
